  "result": "The decision lives in `src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts`. `matchesShortcut` compares the keyboard event's `ctrlKey`, `metaKey`, `altKey`, and `shiftKey` against the modifiers in the registered token list. `prefersMetaKey` decides whether `mod` resolves to Meta (Command) or Control, using a regex on the platform string.\n\n`src/hooks/use-keyboard-shortcut.ts` only calls this logic. It reads `navigator.platform` and passes it in, but it doesn't make the match or mod-key decision itself. The only other `mod` consumers are display and registration (`formatShortcut` in the same file, `COMMAND_PALETTE_SHORTCUT` in `use-command-palette.ts`), not matching.\n\nANSWER: src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts",
